```html
<div class="yuv-profile">

<style>
.yuv-profile{
  --yp-blue:#4361ee;
  --yp-purple:#845ec2;
  --yp-orange:#ff9f43;
  --yp-bg:#f5f7ff;
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  color:#25304a;
  line-height:1.7;
}
.yuv-profile *{box-sizing:border-box}
.yuv-hero{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4361ee,#845ec2);
  color:white;
  padding:55px 25px;
  border-radius:22px;
  text-align:center;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.yuv-hero h1{font-size:38px;margin:10px 0}
.yuv-hero p{font-size:17px;max-width:650px;margin:10px auto}
.yuv-avatar{
  width:110px;height:110px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#fff;color:#6548c7;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:55px;margin:0 auto 15px;
  border:5px solid #ffffff80;
}
.yuv-tag{
  display:inline-block;background:#ffffff25;
  padding:7px 16px;border-radius:30px;margin:5px;
  font-size:13px;
}
.yuv-section{padding:35px 5px}
.yuv-section h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:10px;color:#3949ab}
.yuv-intro{
  background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;
  box-shadow:0 5px 20px #26345b10;
}
.yuv-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));
  gap:17px;margin-top:20px;
}
.yuv-card{
  background:#fff;border-radius:17px;padding:22px;
  border:1px solid #e9eaff;
  box-shadow:0 5px 18px #26345b0c;
  transition:transform .2s;
}
.yuv-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}
.yuv-icon{font-size:37px}
.yuv-card h3{margin:8px 0;color:#3949ab;font-size:19px}
.yuv-card p{font-size:14px;margin:0}
.yuv-quote{
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff1dc,#ffe5f1);
  border-radius:18px;padding:27px;text-align:center;
  font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#70429b;
}
.yuv-goals{
  background:#eef1ff;border-radius:18px;padding:25px;
}
.yuv-goals li{margin:9px 0}
.yuv-footer{
  text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#68718a;
  border-top:1px solid #e7e9f3;font-size:13px;
}
@media(max-width:600px){
 .yuv-hero{padding:38px 18px}
 .yuv-hero h1{font-size:30px}
 .yuv-section{padding:25px 2px}
}
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="yuv-hero">
  <div class="yuv-avatar">🚀</div>
  <span class="yuv-tag">MY LITTLE UNIVERSE</span>
  <h1>Hello, I'm Yuvansh! 👋</h1>
  <p>
    Welcome to my creative world! I love exploring new ideas,
    making games, creating videos, drawing, painting and discovering AI.
  </p>
  <span class="yuv-tag">🎓 Grade 4 Student</span>
  <span class="yuv-tag">🎮 Young Game Creator</span>
  <span class="yuv-tag">🎨 Creative Explorer</span>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT ME -->
<section class="yuv-section">
  <h2>🌟 About Me</h2>
  <div class="yuv-intro">
    <p>
      Hi! I'm <strong>Yuvansh</strong>, a Grade 4 student who loves
      learning, creating and experimenting with new things.
    </p>
    <p>
      I enjoy turning my imagination into something real. Sometimes
      it's a game, sometimes a video, and sometimes a beautiful
      drawing or painting.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am also curious about Artificial Intelligence and how
      technology can help people create amazing things.
    </p>
    <p>
      This website is my little universe where I can share my ideas,
      projects, creativity and learning journey.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MY INTERESTS -->
<section class="yuv-section">
  <h2>🚀 Things I Love</h2>
  <p>These are some of my favourite creative activities.</p>

  <div class="yuv-grid">

    <div class="yuv-card">
      <div class="yuv-icon">🎮</div>
      <h3>Game Development</h3>
      <p>
        I love imagining and making games. I enjoy creating characters,
        levels, challenges and exciting adventures.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="yuv-card">
      <div class="yuv-icon">🎬</div>
      <h3>Video Creation</h3>
      <p>
        I enjoy creating videos, exploring storytelling, adding
        creative ideas and bringing my imagination to life.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="yuv-card">
      <div class="yuv-icon">🎨</div>
      <h3>Arts & Drawing</h3>
      <p>
        Drawing lets me express my thoughts and imagination.
        I love experimenting with shapes, colours and designs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="yuv-card">
      <div class="yuv-icon">🖌️</div>
      <h3>Painting</h3>
      <p>
        I love mixing colours and creating colourful pictures.
        Every painting gives me a chance to try something new.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="yuv-card">
      <div class="yuv-icon">🤖</div>
      <h3>Artificial Intelligence</h3>
      <p>
        I am curious about AI and how smart technology works.
        I enjoy discovering how AI can help with ideas, learning and creativity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="yuv-card">
      <div class="yuv-icon">💡</div>
      <h3>Inventing Ideas</h3>
      <p>
        I like asking questions, solving problems and thinking
        about new things I could build or create.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- MY CREATIVE MINDSET -->
<section class="yuv-section">
  <div class="yuv-quote">
    "I imagine it. I create it. I learn from it. I make it better!" 🌈
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MY DREAMS -->
<section class="yuv-section">
  <h2>🎯 My Dreams & Goals</h2>
  <div class="yuv-goals">
    <ul>
      <li>🎮 Create my own fun and exciting video games.</li>
      <li>🎥 Make interesting and creative videos.</li>
      <li>🎨 Improve my drawing, painting and artistic skills.</li>
      <li>🤖 Learn more about Artificial Intelligence.</li>
      <li>💻 Discover how computers and technology work.</li>
      <li>🌍 Share my creations and inspire other young creators.</li>
      <li>📚 Keep learning something new every day.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MY LEARNING PHILOSOPHY -->
<section class="yuv-section">
  <h2>🧠 My Learning Philosophy</h2>
  <div class="yuv-intro">
    <p>
      I believe learning should be fun, creative and full of discoveries.
      I don't have to know everything today. I just need to keep trying.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every mistake teaches me something. Every new idea is a chance
      to create something amazing!
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<div class="yuv-footer">
  <h3>✨ Thanks for Visiting My Little Universe! ✨</h3>
  <p>Keep dreaming • Keep creating • Keep exploring</p>
  <p>Made with ❤️ and imagination by Yuvansh</p>
</div>

</div>
```
